    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST e-Way Bill Validation:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">For commercial or business assets exceeding the statutory threshold, verify that the transporter generates a valid e-Way bill linked to your GSTIN. This digital document must be scanned and verified at every state checkpoint to avoid penalties, ensuring seamless movement of goods from Patna to Shimoga without bureaucratic hindrance.</p>
