    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Purchase comprehensive marine transit insurance covering 100% of the declared value of your belongings. This IRDAI-compliant policy protects against accidental damage, theft, or loss due to unforeseen delays. Verify the policy coverage terms carefully to ensure full reimbursement for any incident occurring during the transit period.</p>
